OL,3,CEmergency services tackle moorland
OL,4,Cwildfire
OL,6,FFirefighters are working to tackle a
OL,7,Fmoorland fire around Llangynidr
OL,8,FReservoir, near Ebbw Vale.
OL,10,FCrews have been at the fire since late
OL,11,FFriday afternoon (7 August), but
OL,12,Ftackling the smoke is proving to be
OL,13,F'challenging' due to windy conditions.
OL,15,FFirefighting operations are ongoing,
OL,16,Fand currently the fire is affecting
OL,17,Fapproximately two hectares of land
OL,18,Faround the area.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/2
