OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786389519
OL,3,CEmergency services tackle moorland
OL,4,Cwildfire
OL,6,FResources have increased throughout
OL,7,Fthe day to tackle the fire, and there
OL,8,Fare currently eight fire engines and a
OL,9,Frange of specialist vehicles on site.
OL,11,FResidents affected by smoke are being
OL,12,Fadvised to keep windows and doors
OL,13,Fclosed. South Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,14,FService are reminding the public not
OL,15,Fto fly drones near the incident.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/2
